{"id":"a2ef5ac555fe2963","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-composition-operator.md","title":"Composition Operator $\\mathrm{Comp}$","display":"df-composition-operator — Composition Operator $\\mathrm{Comp}$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-composition-operator","aliases":["58-df-composition-operator","58-df-Comp"],"display":"df-composition-operator — Composition Operator $\\mathrm{Comp}$","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-composition-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-composition-operator</span><span>58-df-Comp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-composition-operator — Composition Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m\\in\\omega\">\\(n,m\\in\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\subseteq\\omega^m\\times\\omega\">\\(h\\subseteq\\omega^m\\times\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle g_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega^n\\times\\omega)^m\">\\(\\langle g_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega^n\\times\\omega)^m\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\subseteq\\omega^n\\times\\omega\">\\(c\\subseteq\\omega^n\\times\\omega\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompOperator}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CompOperator}_S\\)</span> (composition-operator predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompOperator}_S(c,h,\\langle g_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle,n,m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\omega^m,\\omega)\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(g_i,\\omega^n,\\omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(c(\\vec x)=h(\\langle g_i(\\vec x)\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}composition\\text{-}operator} \\vdash \\mathrm{CompOperator}_S(c,h,\\langle g_i\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle,n,m)\\leftrightarrow n,m\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{Function}(h,\\omega^m,\\omega)\\land\\forall i\\in m\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(g_i,\\omega^n,\\omega))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,\\omega^n,\\omega)\\land\\forall\\vec x\\in\\omega^n\\;\\bigl(c(\\vec x)=h(\\langle g_i(\\vec x)\\mid i&lt;m\\rangle)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}\\)</span>：复合算子，将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 元输出函数与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元输入函数复合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 元函数</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h, g_0, \\ldots, g_{m-1} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(h, g_0, \\ldots, g_{m-1} \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}(h, g_0, \\ldots, g_{m-1}) \\in \\mathrm{PR}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}(h, g_0, \\ldots, g_{m-1}) \\in \\mathrm{PR}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Related-Concepts\">[Related Concepts]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" href=\"?note=1cf46a0ea13ab5dd\" title=\"58-df-primitive-recursive\">58-df-primitive-recursive</a> — 原始递归函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"886d3e2a93a3e218\" href=\"?note=886d3e2a93a3e218\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md\">../batch02/58-df-primrec-operator.md</a> — 原始递归算子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1507ded5fe871bd8\" href=\"?note=1507ded5fe871bd8\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md\">../batch17/58-df-closure-operator.md</a> — 闭包算子</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Related-Concepts","text":"[Related Concepts]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","emb